(7238725, 1121781, 138253, '<td valign="top">i feel this would have worked better if you cropped the top smoke out of the entry by about 50% of the distance from the top of the main burst and the top of the image (just above that white offshoot from the topmost firework, on the left side). i think the firework top exploding out of frame wouldn''t be as detrimental to score as more empty space/smoke above the main burst might be.<br/>but, that''s just my opinion on the image.<br/>a 6 from me.</td>', 'i feel this would have worked better if you cropped the top smoke out of the entry by about 50% of the distance from the top of the main burst and the top of the image (just above that white offshoot from the topmost firework, on the left side). i think the firework top exploding out of frame wouldn''t be as detrimental to score as more empty space/smoke above the main burst might be.but, that''s just my opinion on the image.a 6 from me.', '2014-07-08 14:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
