(7242098, 1121641, 138253, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chazoe:</b></div><hr/><i> I understand you''re trying to make a statement, it''s just too bad the statement didn''t come with a better photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>*trying* would mean it required explanation, It is fairly straightforward and was received without requests for context by anybody, so i would say it succeded.<br/>As for putting more time into it, there was not really much point as it succeeded in its intended purpose exactly as it existed, not everybody sees the need to change things into something they were not intended to be for the sake of other people. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-07-18 11:11:55.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by chazoe: I understand you''re trying to make a statement, it''s just too bad the statement didn''t come with a better photo.  *trying* would mean it required explanation, It is fairly straightforward and was received without requests for context by anybody, so i would say it succeded.As for putting more time into it, there was not really much point as it succeeded in its intended purpose exactly as it existed, not everybody sees the need to change things into something they were not intended to be for the sake of other people. :)', '2014-07-18 12:11:13.000000', '2014-07-18 12:11:55.000000', 0),
